Submodules (third_party/)
-------------------------

third_party/openpi
  openpi by Physical Intelligence (https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi), Apache-2.0,
  with the AXIS-Bench training and serving hooks. Its LICENSE_GEMMA.txt holds the Gemma Terms of
  Use, which apply to the pi0.5 weights.

third_party/lerobot
  LeRobot by Hugging Face (https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot), Apache-2.0, Copyright 2024 The
  Hugging Face team, with the AXIS-Bench signal hooks for SmolVLA and X-VLA.

third_party/axis-render
  The AXIS-Render evaluation subset, Apache-2.0, with:
  - assets/robots/robotiq_2f85/: the Robotiq 2F-85 model from MuJoCo Menagerie
    (https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie, commit 71f066ad), BSD-2-Clause,
    Copyright (c) 2013, ROS-Industrial. Its LICENSE ships in that directory.
  - assets/table_textures/: textures from Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com), CC0-1.0.
  - config/scenes/: AXIS-authored procedural scene recipes, Apache-2.0. They cite Kujiale showcase
    scenes by number; no Kujiale asset is included.


