Checkpoints (https://huggingface.co/axisrobotics)
-------------------------------------------------

qvla-v1-pi05
  pi0.5 checkpoints. pi0.5 derives from PaliGemma (Gemma), so these are Model Derivatives of Gemma:
  Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at ai.google.dev/gemma/terms
  (a copy: LICENSE_GEMMA.txt in the repository and in third_party/openpi).
  The checkpoints are modified weights: the AXIS-Bench authors further pretrained and fine-tuned
  Physical Intelligence's pi05_base and pi05_droid to produce them.
  Their use is subject to the use restrictions of Section 3.2 of the Gemma Terms of Use, including the
  Gemma Prohibited Use Policy at ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy.

qvla-v1-smolvla
  SmolVLA checkpoints, Apache-2.0, trained from lerobot/smolvla_base, which builds on
  HuggingFaceTB/SmolVLM2-500M-Video-Instruct (Apache-2.0).

qvla-v1-xvla
  X-VLA checkpoints, Apache-2.0, trained from lerobot/xvla-base with the facebook/bart-large
  tokenizer (both Apache-2.0).


Base weights (downloaded from their publishers, not redistributed)
------------------------------------------------------------------

`qvla data get base-weights` downloads each base from its publisher, whose terms you accept;
conf/recipes/bases.lock.json pins every file:
  - pi05_droid and pi05_base (gs://openpi-assets/checkpoints/) and the PaliGemma tokenizer
    (gs://big_vision/paligemma_tokenizer.model): the Gemma Terms of Use, with the use restrictions
    of its Section 3.2.
  - smolvla_base (lerobot/smolvla_base) and SmolVLM2-500M-Video-Instruct
    (HuggingFaceTB/SmolVLM2-500M-Video-Instruct): Apache-2.0.
  - xvla_base (lerobot/xvla-base) and its tokenizer facebook/bart-large: Apache-2.0.


Real-robot data tools
---------------------

The FR3 real-robot data tools (axis_qvla/realrobot/realdata) re-implement data-preparation steps written by
Litian Gong and Zhixu Li for the FR3 dataset Litian2002/tasl-fr3-10task-250ep-video.


